function taxonomyNormalize_(v){return String(v===undefined||v===null?'':v).toLowerCase().replace(/ё/g,'е').replace(/і/g,'i').replace(/ї/g,'i').replace(/є/g,'e').replace(/ґ/g,'g').replace(/[áä]/g,'a').replace(/č/g,'c').replace(/ď/g,'d').replace(/[éě]/g,'e').replace(/í/g,'i').replace(/ň/g,'n').replace(/[óö]/g,'o').replace(/ř/g,'r').replace(/š/g,'s').replace(/ť/g,'t').replace(/[úůü]/g,'u').replace(/ý/g,'y').replace(/ž/g,'z').replace(/[^a-zа-я0-9+.#-]+/g,' ').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim();}
function taxonomySplit_(v){if(Array.isArray(v))return v.map(function(x){return String(x||'').trim();}).filter(Boolean);return String(v||'').split(/[,;\n]+/).map(function(x){return String(x||'').trim();}).filter(Boolean);}
function taxonomyAllEntries_(){var out=[];(UNIVERSAL_TAXONOMY_V2.categories||[]).forEach(function(c){(c.professions||[]).forEach(function(p){out.push(p);});});(UNIVERSAL_TAXONOMY_V2.brigadeSpecializations||[]).forEach(function(p){out.push(p);});return out;}
function taxonomyFind_(value){var q=taxonomyNormalize_(value);if(!q)return null;var all=taxonomyAllEntries_();for(var i=0;i<all.length;i++){var p=all[i],variants=[p.name].concat(p.searchVariants||[],p.trueSynonyms||[],p.colloquial||[],p.czech||[]);for(var j=0;j<variants.length;j++)if(taxonomyNormalize_(variants[j])===q)return p;}for(var k=0;k<all.length;k++){var p2=all[k],n=taxonomyNormalize_(p2.name);if(n.indexOf(q)>=0||q.indexOf(n)>=0)return p2;}return null;}
function taxonomyCanonicalList_(value){var vals=taxonomySplit_(value),out=[],seen={};vals.forEach(function(v){var p=taxonomyFind_(v),n=p&&p.name?p.name:v,key=taxonomyNormalize_(n);if(key&&!seen[key]){seen[key]=1;out.push(n);}});return out;}
function taxonomyFindBrigade_(value){var q=taxonomyNormalize_(value);if(!q)return null;var all=UNIVERSAL_TAXONOMY_V2.brigadeSpecializations||[];for(var i=0;i<all.length;i++){var p=all[i],variants=[p.name].concat(p.searchVariants||[],p.trueSynonyms||[],p.colloquial||[],p.czech||[]);for(var j=0;j<variants.length;j++)if(taxonomyNormalize_(variants[j])===q)return p;}for(var k=0;k<all.length;k++){var p2=all[k],n=taxonomyNormalize_(p2.name);if(n.indexOf(q)>=0||q.indexOf(n)>=0)return p2;}return taxonomyFind_(value);}
function taxonomyCanonicalBrigadeList_(value){var vals=taxonomySplit_(value),out=[],seen={};vals.forEach(function(v){var p=taxonomyFindBrigade_(v),n=p&&p.name?p.name:v,key=taxonomyNormalize_(n);if(key&&!seen[key]){seen[key]=1;out.push(n);}});return out;}
function taxonomyNormalizeEntity_(x){x=x||{};var type=String(x.type||x.announcementType||'');if(type==='Бригада ищет работу'||type==='Ищу бригаду'){x.specialization=taxonomyCanonicalBrigadeList_(x.specialization||'').join(', ');x.workTypes=taxonomyCanonicalBrigadeList_(x.workTypes||x.professions||'').join(', ');x.professions=x.workTypes||String(x.professions||'').trim();}else{x.profession=taxonomyCanonicalList_(x.profession||'').join(', ')||String(x.profession||'').trim();}return x;}
function taxonomyScore_(candidate,query){var q=taxonomyNormalize_(query),best=0;if(!q)return 0;taxonomySplit_(candidate).forEach(function(v){var p=taxonomyFind_(v);if(!p)return;var n=taxonomyNormalize_(p.name);if(n===q)best=Math.max(best,100);if((p.trueSynonyms||[]).map(taxonomyNormalize_).indexOf(q)>=0||(p.czech||[]).map(taxonomyNormalize_).indexOf(q)>=0)best=Math.max(best,95);if((p.colloquial||[]).map(taxonomyNormalize_).indexOf(q)>=0)best=Math.max(best,90);if((p.related||[]).map(taxonomyNormalize_).indexOf(q)>=0)best=Math.max(best,70);if((p.adjacent||[]).map(taxonomyNormalize_).indexOf(q)>=0)best=Math.max(best,45);});return best;}
function getUniversalTaxonomy_(){return {ok:true,version:UNIVERSAL_TAXONOMY_V2.version,taxonomy:UNIVERSAL_TAXONOMY_V2};}
